5. DISCLAIMER
   The Software is a decision-support tool ("پشتیبان کارشناس"), NOT a
   replacement for qualified human inspection. Outputs must be reviewed by
   certified NDT personnel per API 1104, ASME Section V, ASME Section VIII,
   and ASME B31.3. The Licensor is not liable for decisions taken solely on
   the basis of the Software without such review.

